    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. In your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), pick an **SKITARII** unit of yours that you have yet to select to move. A **BATTLELINE** pick lets you add a friendly non-BATTLELINE **SKITARII** unit up to 6\" away. Through phase end, an [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) by either pick adds 6\" to its models’ Move instead of using an [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) roll.",
